WEBVTT

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.101
We struggled,

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:02.542
but we found our way.

00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:05.893
And let Sekou tell it,

00:07:05.917 --> 00:07:08.184
we're the best parents in the world.

00:07:08.208 --> 00:07:10.601
I love that he sees us that way.

00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:12.768
We made a choice in the beginning

00:07:12.792 --> 00:07:16.976
to co-parent as allies 
and not adversaries.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.101
To break the toxic pattern

00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:21.934
that we see play out over and over again

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:25.809
when parents lose focus
on what's most important,

00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:27.101
the children.

00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:30.143
They allow their relationship pain
to get in the way.